  "sourceTitle": "We released VeriLoop E2 (27B, Apache-2.0). The design question behind it: should an LLM be allowed to commit its own state?",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2ee5292104828b50c4dbd9ae5afdbd848dedd61e0b7256e3b1bac149d2198b5e",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-27T19:04:45.636401Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T19:06:46.386215Z",
  "totalBlocks": 53,
  "translatedBlocks": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eda7be03281f8c54",
      "translationZh": "披露：我是 VeriLoop E2 的作者之一，这是一个基于 Qwen3.8-27B 进行后训练的 27B 模型。权重采用 Apache-2.0 协议；我们用于评估它的测试框架并非开源（详情见文末）。这是一篇发布文章，但我不想只是堆砌基准测试数据，而是想谈谈我们构建该模型时遵循的设计规则，因为我认为那部分更有趣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdf29859e3e54b0c",
      "translationZh": "这个问题在我们构建长程代码和研究工作流时浮现了出来：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82437e59939b164a",
      "translationZh": "当一个模型提议一个“更好”的状态时，是什么赋予了该状态替换我们已经验证过的状态的权利？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe5397dda9c7c72c",
      "translationZh": "显而易见的答案是“运行一个验证器”。但这仍然留下了一个状态管理问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "586ad2d2c51041f2",
      "translationZh": "假设现有状态在三个受保护义务上的排名（0 = 已满足）为",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8b5858d00bfdbf6",
      "translationZh": "如果你将这些简化为一个标量，B 可能会看起来很有吸引力，因为总错误计数从 2 降到了 1。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25b97907c6c0eb19",
      "translationZh": "但 B 也破坏了第一个义务，而该义务之前已经是满足状态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52b88fc7a9eec38e",
      "translationZh": "我们在 VeriLoop-Governed Recurrence (VGR) 中最终使用的规则刻意更加严格：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c1a125f015fb2c2",
      "translationZh": "因此 A 提交了。B 和 C 没有。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ceb778a48e4977a5",
      "translationZh": "模型获得提案权。验证器/控制器获得持久化权。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6220f2d36c9e89e7",
      "translationZh": "这听起来是一个微小的区别，但它改变了我们对智能体状态的思考方式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c532034c2ba67245",
      "translationZh": "被拒绝的候选方案既不是“基本被接受”，也不会被允许泄露到保留状态中。保留的包保持不变：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "565242bfd5d380f3",
      "translationZh": "绑定 / 身份元数据",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2992baee9da73172",
      "translationZh": "失败的提案仍可用作下一次尝试的证据，但它不会成为新的现任者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0fb0601291e2326",
      "translationZh": "这基本上是对任务状态的一种受保护的部分序，而不是一个标量“看起来更好”的分数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d69beedd5611bc70",
      "translationZh": "我觉得更有趣的部分是，同一条规则可以为你提供训练信号。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81607286299954dc",
      "translationZh": "对于同一个在任者，经过外部检查的候选者可以分为：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70fa3a28c64fb2ce",
      "translationZh": "这比“好/坏回答”这种标签要丰富得多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "431a1d8cddc5d1da",
      "translationZh": "一个经过验证的严格进展候选者可以转变为修正监督。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a65588d87a88ffab",
      "translationZh": "一个零排位的伪影可以转变为最终生成目标。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bbb74890e553e15",
      "translationZh": "一个退化或不可比的候选者可以转变为负面示例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60c0aea4914decfc",
      "translationZh": "验证器本身保持在梯度路径之外。训练改变了模型可能提出的建议；它并不教导模型去自我授权状态转换。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1013d4165b90b920",
      "translationZh": "这是我们实际在 VeriLoop E2 中使用的 VGR 部分。E2 是当前系统中的模型端推理器/提议者：负责提议生成、抽象、诊断、路径选择和重新规划。外部 Harness/验证器仍然负责执行、受保护的比较、回滚和认证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34d5b9ecdb339ffe",
      "translationZh": "这里一个声明边界非常重要：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e504edadd991389d",
      "translationZh": "目前的 E2 证据支持 VGR 的轨迹监督实现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a94f90068e48dc43",
      "translationZh": "换句话说，该模型是通过验证器管理的状态转移进行后期训练的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee418dc29d24c2a5",
      "translationZh": "这并不等同于声称我们报告中所描述的完整的潜状态 VGR 算子已经端到端地集成在 Qwen 主干网络中。真正的潜实现需要其自身的证据：受控的激活位置、解码器/缓存一致性、梯度路径以及推理轨迹。我们将这些主张分开对待。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa7351f7c5cb8fb2",
      "translationZh": "我认为提交规则有两个确定性的属性是有用的：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "adcbbaade5cfcfe7",
      "translationZh": "受保护的非退化性：已提交的状态不能使任何受保护的坐标恶化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f0585bdc04b617c",
      "translationZh": "有限严格提交：如果秩坐标是非负整数，每次提交都会使其总和至少减少 1，因此严格提交的数量受初始秩总和的限制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72f518c1979c7f5d",
      "translationZh": "但这两个属性都不意味着“模型将解决任务”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5da88069c849d685",
      "translationZh": "如果提议者无法达到可接受的改进，运行可能会停滞。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29ef4d8275044495",
      "translationZh": "而秩零仅意味着“在此验证器合约下是完整的”。它对于验证器的覆盖范围之外的内容不作任何说明。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "351723d7230b92af",
      "translationZh": "因此，VGR 本身并不是一个证明系统。它是一条用于决定什么可以持续存在的规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89d940ae281dc53e",
      "translationZh": "我很好奇这里的人们会如何处理这条规则过于保守的情况。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f1939114991ae63",
      "translationZh": "例如，某些真实的智能体任务可能需要暂时打破某件事，以便稍后解锁一个更好的状态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4006fcd247cd2e03",
      "translationZh": "保持受保护的顺序是硬性的，并强制提议者寻找一条非退化的路径；",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6242cb7109cab75",
      "translationZh": "允许在隔离的沙盒内进行临时的退化，但绝不提交它们；",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc1ea5be2c018382",
      "translationZh": "或者让提交关系变为概率性的或是有预算限制的？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "170423959ad9775c",
      "translationZh": "我也很感兴趣人们会在局部智能体中将状态边界置于何处：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af14b8226408b620",
      "translationZh": "独立性能：[请填写，任选其一：“在不使用 harness 的情况下，E2 对比基础版 Qwen3.8-27B：……” 或 “我们尚未发布独立性能数据。如果您在不使用 harness 的情况下运行它，我很想听听它的表现。”]",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb80ab47e3805582",
      "translationZh": "技术报告（如果您想要比我的 Reddit 摘要更详细的精确形式化描述）：https://openreview.net/forum?id=P6FIQILHwX",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11666bb30f50f01b",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/PleaseLee 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
